kubernetes v1.35.10 (commit ae6fece6fea92ecfcccd13af7d5f2ea8cb9b33fe), root module only: golang.org/x/net v0.56.0 ->
v0.62.0 (CVE-2026-78661, CVE-2026-78669), golang.org/x/text v0.39.0 -> v0.43.0 (CVE-2026-56851; v0.43.0 is what
x/net v0.62.0 requires) and what they force: the go directive 1.26.0, x/crypto, x/mod, x/sync, x/sys, x/term, x/tools.
Made with Go 1.26.10 in the upstream tree, GOWORK=off GOFLAGS=-mod=mod:
go get golang.org/x/net@v0.62.0 golang.org/x/text@v0.43.0 && go mod tidy.
go.sum keeps the upstream lines that tidy drops without the workspace: this patch only adds lines to it.
The go.sum lines are what the build verifies every module download against (GOFLAGS=-mod=readonly).

